   "content": "Lior Alexander @LiorOnAI Click to Follow LiorOnAI Must read: A Comprehensive Overview of RL by Kevin Murphy (on ArXiv). This new tutorial paper gives you a full-picture view of modern RL—value-based, policy gradient, model-based, and more. 8:30 PM · Apr 8, 2025 · 14.4K Views Lior Alexander @LiorOnAI · Apr 8 arxiv.org Reinforcement Learning: An Overview This manuscript gives a big-picture, up-to-date overview of the field of (deep) reinforcement learning and sequential decision making, covering value-based methods, policy-based methods,... ryan yang @yangyc666 · Apr 9 Solid overview. RL's iterative nature aligns with phased integration—test policies in modules, track reward metrics. Murphy’s breakdown helps cut through the noise. Practical for real-world system tweaks."
